---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="What this static site does with your visit.">
	<main id="content" class="wrap page-title">
		<h1>Privacy</h1>
		<div class="prose">
			<p>
				Fleming AI is a static site. There are no accounts, comments, or forms that store what you
				type. Pages are files served over HTTPS.
			</p>
			<p>
				The site itself does not run advertising or a first-party analytics tracker. Your browser
				will still talk to Cloudflare, which hosts the site, and to any third-party page you open
				from a link, such as YouTube.
			</p>
			<p>
				The theme switch remembers light or dark mode in local storage on your device. That choice
				stays in the browser.
			</p>
			<p>
				Questions: <a href="mailto:me@jonfleming.com">me@jonfleming.com</a>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</main>
</Base>
